{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 11 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">物理约束重建：从后处理到展开优化与测量一致性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Physics-Informed Recon</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_050_modl-title\">MoDL</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">共享 CNN prior 与可微共轭梯度 data-consistency 子问题交替展开。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Alternates a weight-shared multi-layer CNN denoiser prior D_θ with a differentiable numerical Conjugate Gradient (CG) solver enforcing exact data consistency (A*A + λI)^{-1}.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">测量 y、已知前向算子 A 与伴随 A*</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Undersampled multi-coil k-space measurements b, forward operator A (incorporating coil maps + FFT + mask), and adjoint A*</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">K 次共享权重迭代后的重建 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Reconstructed MRI image x_K after K weight-shared alternating minimization stages</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.3</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30106719/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_050_modl')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_050_modl')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"MoDL original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/97f6fa72832c943d8fef.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.3</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 9 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_050_modl\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_050_modl')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_050_modl\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 09 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">MRI k-space 或其他线性成像测量</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests undersampled multi-coil k-space measurements b, forward operator a (incorporating coil maps + fft + mask), and adjoint a* and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"MRI k-space 或其他线性成像测量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests undersampled multi-coil k-space measurements b, forward operator a (incorporating coil maps + fft + mask), and adjoint a* and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"测量 y\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">测量 y</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">MRI k-space 或其他线性成像测量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests undersampled multi-coil k-space measurements b, forward operator a (incorporating coil maps + fft + mask), and adjoint a* and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"成像 forward/adjoint；构成 A*A 与 A*y\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes A / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"A / A*\" data-node-name-en=\"A / A*\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>A / A*</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">成像 forward/adjoint；构成 A*A 与 A*y</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes A / A* to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"A*y 初始化的当前图像\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs x_k within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"状态 x_k\" data-node-name-en=\"x_k\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">状态 x_k</span><span class=\"lang-en\">x_k</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">A*y 初始化的当前图像</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs x_k within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"D_theta(x_k) 在各级复用同一组卷积参数\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CNN within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"共享 CNN\" data-node-name-en=\"CNN\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">共享 CNN</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CNN</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">D_theta(x_k) 在各级复用同一组卷积参数</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CNN within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CNN 给出的去伪影/去噪候选\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs prior z_k within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"先验变量 z_k\" data-node-name-en=\"prior z_k\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">先验变量 z_k</span><span class=\"lang-en\">prior z_k</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CNN 给出的去伪影/去噪候选</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs prior z_k within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"近似求解 (A*A+lambda I)x=A*y+lambda z_k\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs CG data consistency within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"CG 数据一致性\" data-node-name-en=\"CG data consistency\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">CG 数据一致性</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CG data consistency</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">近似求解 (A*A+lambda I)x=A*y+lambda z_k</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs CG data consistency within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"D_theta 和 lambda 跨 unrolled iterations 共享\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 07 within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"权重共享\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">权重共享</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">D_theta 和 lambda 跨 unrolled iterations 共享</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 07 within the core unrolled denoiser cg reconstruction computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"CNN prior 与 CG/DC 子问题交替\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies K unrolled to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"K 次展开\" data-node-name-en=\"K unrolled\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">K 次展开</span><span class=\"lang-en\">K unrolled</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">CNN prior 与 CG/DC 子问题交替</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies K unrolled to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"最后一次 CG 解\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces reconstructed mri image x_k after k weight-shared alternating minimization stages via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_050_modl', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">最后一次 CG 解</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces reconstructed mri image x_k after k weight-shared alternating minimization stages via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"MoDL Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 共享去噪先验与 CG 数据一致性方程</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Weight-Shared CNN Denoiser Coupled with Unrolled Conjugate Gradient Data-Consistency Sub-Problem</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"MoDL：核心公式 · 共享去噪先验与 CG 数据一致性方程\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"50\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"9.419698pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" styl