77 .970905-1.883845C.970905-3.49236 1.267973-4.325599 2.20265-5.079137L2.13744-5.195066Z\" id=\"m050_g4-185\"></path><path d=\"M.275331-5.195066L.210121-5.079137C1.144798-4.325599 1.441866-3.49236 1.441866-1.883845C1.441866-.282577 1.166535 .594136 .210121 1.347674L.297068 1.463603C1.296955 .84773 2.064984-.514435 2.064984-1.862109C2.064984-3.340203 1.325937-4.513984 .275331-5.195066Z\" id=\"m050_g4-186\"></path><path d=\"M2.85475 0V-.108683C2.282351-.115929 2.166422-.188385 2.166422-.536171V-4.883507L2.108458-4.897998L.804257-4.238652V-4.137214C.891204-4.173442 .970905-4.202424 .999887-4.216916C1.130307-4.267635 1.253482-4.296617 1.325937-4.296617C1.478094-4.296617 1.543304-4.187933 1.543304-3.956075V-.673837C1.543304-.434734 1.48534-.268086 1.369411-.202876C1.260727-.137666 1.15929-.115929 .854976-.108683V0H2.85475Z\" id=\"m050_g17-49\"></path></defs><g id=\"m050_page1\"><use x=\"-68.772107\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-73\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-64.270491\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g10-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"-57.008685\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g1-61\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-47.536502\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-25\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-39.0548\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g10-92\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"-33.778539\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g7-185\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-30.062479\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-71\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-25.012914\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g10-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"-20.51844\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g7-186\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-16.702765\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-150\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"-1.981357\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g7-185\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"2.4819\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-22\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"8.698576\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g4-3\" y=\"-65.702134\"></use><use x=\"13.369352\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-22\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"21.799894\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g7-184\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"30.220486\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-95\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"36.143271\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-30\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"40.188086\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g7-186\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"44.003761\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-71\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"49.053326\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g10-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"53.049679\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g4-184\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"57.675133\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g17-49\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use><use x=\"64.576936\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g1-61\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"74.4277\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-22\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"80.644376\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g4-3\" y=\"-65.702134\"></use><use x=\"84.966461\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-72\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"91.982318\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g7-184\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"100.40291\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-95\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"106.156329\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g13-73\" y=\"-61.587574\"></use><use x=\"110.657945\" xlink:href=\"#m050_g10-58\" y=\"-60.093193\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">各展开 stage 独立参数导致模型大且数据需求高</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Gradient-step unrolled networks converged slowly for complex multi-coil forward operators A whose normal operator A*A is not diagonally invertible.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">共享 CNN denoiser，并用有限次共轭梯度近似求解每步 data-consistency 子问题</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Share a single CNN denoiser across all K unrolled stages to reduce parameters, and solve the quadratic data-consistency sub-problem accurately via internal CG iterations.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">跨迭代共享 learned prior，加 A* A 线性系统的 CG 更新</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Weight-shared plug-and-play regularizer + backpropagation through numerical Conjugate Gradient steps handling arbitrary linear operators A.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">成为多线圈 MRI 和 CT model-based deep learning 强基线</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Core infrastructure baseline for multi-coil parallel MRI, dynamic cardiac MRI, and physics-based CT reconstruction.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">基础设施级方法；依赖 operator/coil maps 且迭代计算较重</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Mandatory unrolled baseline; depends on accurate coil sensitivity maps and incurs inner-loop CG compute cost.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">将 learned denoiser 视为模型先验，并用显式线性子问题恢复测量一致性。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">CG 只需要 A 和 A* 的矩阵—向量乘，无需显式存储 A*A。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">跨迭代共享 CNN 参数显著缩小模型，但把各级先验更新约束为同一映射。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Share a single CNN denoiser across all K unrolled stages to reduce parameters, and solve the quadratic data-consistency sub-problem accurately via internal CG iterations.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Weight-shared plug-and-play regularizer + backpropagation through numerical Conjugate Gradient steps handling arbitrary linear operators A.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Weight-Shared CNN Denoiser Coupled with Unrolled Conjugate Gradient Data-Consistency Sub-Problem.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">适用于多线圈 MRI、CT 等可准确实现 A/A* 的线性逆问题，是 model-based deep learning 的强基线。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">线圈图、几何或噪声模型错误会进入每次 CG；K 与每级 CG 步数共同决定延迟。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Core infrastructure baseline for multi-coil parallel MRI, dynamic cardiac MRI, and physics-based CT reconstruction.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Mandatory unrolled baseline; depends on accurate coil sensitivity maps and incurs inner-loop CG compute cost.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30106719/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>MoDL: Model-Based Deep Learning Architecture for Inverse Problems</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/hkaggarwal/modl\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}
